# README demo: the Desert Palms Software logo, the title, then a whole
# rescue trip (same route as tests/rescue.agk), with a little extra time on
# the title and at the end. The logo takes the first 4.6 s of the video.
# Record with:  agk record demo/showcase.agk --readme --gif demo/rotor-rescue.gif --gif-start 8.6 --gif-seconds 12
wait 230
wait-serial "AGK t0"
wait 100
press fire 2
wait 125
press up 30
press left 170
wait 60
press down 70
press fire 1
wait 25
press fire 1
wait 30
wait 290
press up 30
press right 180
wait 50
press down 70
wait 320
